  "rationale": "Among the 9 retrieved candidates, only PGS003448 has trait_reported/trait_efo matching the target disease (acute lymphoblastic leukemia). However, its endpoint fidelity is internally inconsistent because phenotyping_reported is listed as “Chronic lymphocytic leukemia,” which (per the provided hematologic malignancy policy) is a material disease-identity difference and suggests metadata/endpoint incoherence. In addition, it provides no AUROC/R2 discrimination metrics and only a near-null effect size (OR=0.95, 0.90–1.00), which offers weak support for PRS utility. All other candidates are for chronic lymphocytic leukemia and are not direct matches for the target. Therefore a direct-match candidate exists but is poorly supported/ambiguous, making the selection sub-optimal."
